    "excerpt": "Finding a high-refresh esports gaming monitor under $200 no longer requires settling for sluggish pixel response or washed-out colors. Here are the top 180Hz and 240Hz Fast IPS and Curved VA gaming monitors tested for 0.5ms clarity, input lag, and value in 2026.",
