    "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80",
    "excerpt": "GitHub Copilot costs $10–$19/month. These 6 completely free VS Code extensions provide AI code completion, chat, and agentic editing powered by GPT-4o, Claude, Gemini, or your own local Ollama models — no subscription required.",
    "featured": false,
