    "excerpt": "Building the perfect gaming PC on a budget in 2026 without wasting money on the wrong parts. Complete component lists, benchmarks, and compatibility checks for three price tiers: $400 (1080p 60FPS), $600 (1080p 144FPS), and $900 (1440p 144FPS).",
