    "author": {
      "name": "Tech Boss",
      "avatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80",
      "role": "Founder & Author"
    },
    "date": "Sep 15, 2021",
    "timestamp": 1631682120000,
    "readTime": "4 min read",
    "image": "https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEguX9YIgezPDI8xAy_3keL3d5jn5E-D_EA7xpaQ5F74pQbh0Yw-1tTh0oL5r4B9L87AcH4uf0DQUCg-3uaINdhUR-E6WmENYErYWxQhp92k1-f-souwPFB0WppKiBz4zbyWP3iMZUkHu8qH/s320/Screenshot+%2528131%2529.png",
    "excerpt": "Detailed Semester IV Database Management System (DBMS) lecture notes covering ER diagrams, Relational Algebra, SQL queries, Normalization (1NF to BCNF), and ACID transaction control.",
    "content": "\n<div class=\"mb-6 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50/60 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-blue-100 dark:border-slate-800\">\n  <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">📘 Course Overview: Database Management Systems (DBMS)</h2>\n  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n    Database Management Systems (DBMS) provides the mathematical and practical architecture for storing, querying, and managing structured and relational data at scale. These notes are curated specifically to help students ace university examinations and technical job interviews.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-2\">Key Modules &amp; Syllabus Covered:</h3>\n  <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1.5 mb-4\">\n    <li><strong>Unit 1: Introduction &amp; Data Models:</strong> File system vs. DBMS, 3-level ANSI-SPARC architecture, Data Independence (Physical &amp; Logical), Entity-Relationship (ER) model and Extended ER (Generalization, Specialization, Aggregation).</li>\n    <li><strong>Unit 2: Relational Model &amp; Algebra:</strong> Relational constraints, keys (Primary, Candidate, Foreign, Super), Relational Algebra operations (Select, Project, Cartesian Product, Join, Division).</li>\n    <li><strong>Unit 3: SQL &amp; Advanced Queries:</strong> DDL, DML, DCL, complex nested subqueries, Joins (Inner, Left, Right, Full Outer), aggregate functions, and Views.</li>\n    <li><strong>Unit 4: Relational Database Design &amp; Normalization:</strong> Functional Dependencies, Armstrong axioms, 1NF, 2NF, 3NF, Boyce-Codd Normal Form (BCNF), multi-valued dependencies and 4NF.</li>\n    <li><strong>Unit 5: Transaction Processing &amp; Concurrency Control:</strong> ACID properties, serializability (Conflict &amp; View), Two-Phase Locking (2PL), Deadlock prevention and detection, WAL (Write-Ahead Logging).</li>\n    <li><strong>Unit 6: Storage &amp; Indexing:</strong> File organization, primary vs. secondary indexing, B-Trees and B+ Trees index structures.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">\n    💡 <strong>Exam Tip:</strong> Always master Normalization decomposition problems and step-by-step ER to Relational schema conversion rules.\n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">📄 Notes Preview &amp; Download Links:</h3>\n\n<p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEguX9YIgezPDI8xAy_3keL3d5jn5E-D_EA7xpaQ5F74pQbh0Yw-1tTh0oL5r4B9L87AcH4uf0DQUCg-3uaINdhUR-E6WmENYErYWxQhp92k1-f-souwPFB0WppKiBz4zbyWP3iMZUkHu8qH/s1920/Screenshot+%2528131%2529.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1080\" data-original-width=\"1920\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEguX9YIgezPDI8xAy_3keL3d5jn5E-D_EA7xpaQ5F74pQbh0Yw-1tTh0oL5r4B9L87AcH4uf0DQUCg-3uaINdhUR-E6WmENYErYWxQhp92k1-f-souwPFB0WppKiBz4zbyWP3iMZUkHu8qH/s320/Screenshot+%2528131%2529.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br />&nbsp;<p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgugcWOpk1WjsiG8GS3iiKkz7T7t_gkTiPhVZvCC_63dEB3AirM1sYdAVPlXBdUOOnj3oq7zJoTIohdGlwRsZVWwOw7HRd6FqbIUlNTULM6mCpnhB3ttwLyi8VdVSAYj2kyFihV1CrjE2JS/s1920/Screenshot+%2528133%2529.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1080\" data-original-width=\"1920\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgugcWOpk1WjsiG8GS3iiKkz7T7t_gkTiPhVZvCC_63dEB3AirM1sYdAVPlXBdUOOnj3oq7zJoTIohdGlwRsZVWwOw7HRd6FqbIUlNTULM6mCpnhB3ttwLyi8VdVSAYj2kyFihV1CrjE2JS/s320/Screenshot+%2528133%2529.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiq6lCWmXXrcsJJAf4uVVwuXoCjR8JE4fJkdurIURqiQvQml7bDZ844mj9zQlBTHAJ9ol64WT5A5FARjmvZh9pEbN46ij0NBtclEERsIp3UMDO72a5dLAoRki4XLTeCPOFH-b5rLMySlcwX/s1920/Screenshot+%2528132%2529.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1080\" data-original-width=\"1920\" height=\"180\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiq6lCWmXXrcsJJAf4uVVwuXoCjR8JE4fJkdurIURqiQvQml7bDZ844mj9zQlBTHAJ9ol64WT5A5FARjmvZh9pEbN46ij0NBtclEERsIp3UMDO72a5dLAoRki4XLTeCPOFH-b5rLMySlcwX/s320/Screenshot+%2528132%2529.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1g_3pDrCXb5Y2UKhFygvD1NoWtw1Mx7Ov/view?usp=sharing\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\" target=\"_blank\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"117\" data-original-width=\"345\" height=\"71\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhCQTcW6twHVIsbujfk7aYCdgE5b8uG3nqVFssVGnyYPvizxaJMUty8tLwRCI9uVfYkGzIgZ7YfJe37NT-UpfaV6qXYIXigkhv_Gypcwgd7XjiKGTEJpZvQojy1b6BI7PZbPrT-U9EBi1GW/w257-h71/download_en.png\" width=\"257\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br />",
