    "id": "blogger-1",
    "title": "Semester II Mathematics-II Notes",
    "category": "Education & Notes",
    "tags": [],
    "author": {
      "name": "Tech Boss",
      "avatar": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1534528741775-53994a69daeb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=150&q=80",
      "role": "Founder & Author"
    },
    "date": "Sep 6, 2021",
    "timestamp": 1630941480001,
    "readTime": "4 min read",
    "image": "https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgYsunnEnbC-1wSNJeNry6lfNWtzLMsAOvx0A0zwtH4n4AFuztX4Q6veBwnLMgF3Ev5wFTKKjRnlqDi5pErr1MbtpodyqHnjp6zIXX6t2F04pkkEkr-8PYFdis1xgygxJfhO0EsUc-VNWHf/s320/Screenshot_2021-09-06-20-58-03-786_cn.wps.xiaomi.abroad.lite.jpg",
    "excerpt": "Semester II Engineering Mathematics-II handwritten lecture notes covering Ordinary Differential Equations (ODEs), Vector Calculus, Laplace Transforms, and Partial Differential Equations (PDEs).",
    "content": "\n<div class=\"mb-6 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-blue-50/60 dark:bg-slate-800 border border-blue-100 dark:border-slate-800\">\n  <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">📘 Course Overview: Engineering Mathematics-II (Semester II)</h2>\n  <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4\">\n    Engineering Mathematics-II is a critical foundational course across all engineering disciplines. It equips students with the advanced mathematical machinery needed to solve physical systems, signal modeling, circuit dynamics, and structural mechanics.\n  </p>\n  \n  <h3 class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mb-2\">Key Modules &amp; Syllabus Covered:</h3>\n  <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1.5 mb-4\">\n    <li><strong>Unit 1: First-Order Differential Equations:</strong> Exact differential equations, integrating factors, linear differential equations of first order, Bernoulli's equation, orthogonal trajectories.</li>\n    <li><strong>Unit 2: Higher-Order Linear ODEs:</strong> Homogeneous linear equations with constant coefficients, Method of Undetermined Coefficients, Method of Variation of Parameters, Cauchy-Euler differential equations.</li>\n    <li><strong>Unit 3: Vector Calculus &amp; Integral Theorems:</strong> Gradient of scalar fields, divergence and curl of vector fields, physical interpretations, line integrals, surface integrals, Green's Theorem in a plane, Stokes' Theorem, Gauss Divergence Theorem.</li>\n    <li><strong>Unit 4: Laplace Transforms:</strong> Definition, linearity property, first and second shifting theorems, Laplace transform of derivatives and integrals, unit step function, Dirac delta function, Inverse Laplace transforms by partial fractions and convolution theorem, solving initial-value ODEs.</li>\n    <li><strong>Unit 5: Partial Differential Equations (PDEs):</strong> Formation of PDEs, Lagrange's linear PDE, method of separation of variables for 1D wave equation, 1D heat conduction equation, and 2D Laplace's equation.</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300\">\n    💡 <strong>Exam Tip:</strong> Practice step-by-step application of Gauss Divergence Theorem and solving differential equations using Laplace Transforms.\n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-3\">📄 Notes Preview &amp; Download Links:</h3>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgYsunnEnbC-1wSNJeNry6lfNWtzLMsAOvx0A0zwtH4n4AFuztX4Q6veBwnLMgF3Ev5wFTKKjRnlqDi5pErr1MbtpodyqHnjp6zIXX6t2F04pkkEkr-8PYFdis1xgygxJfhO0EsUc-VNWHf/s2246/Screenshot_2021-09-06-20-58-03-786_cn.wps.xiaomi.abroad.lite.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2246\" data-original-width=\"1080\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgYsunnEnbC-1wSNJeNry6lfNWtzLMsAOvx0A0zwtH4n4AFuztX4Q6veBwnLMgF3Ev5wFTKKjRnlqDi5pErr1MbtpodyqHnjp6zIXX6t2F04pkkEkr-8PYFdis1xgygxJfhO0EsUc-VNWHf/s320/Screenshot_2021-09-06-20-58-03-786_cn.wps.xiaomi.abroad.lite.jpg\" width=\"154\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEglbClq4Br4Jhc4-FVu7BruLHJo6nZBJt1ceg0o62GITM2oXvhGUSAqYFfF_4IdcgqRbdUS0cfix27EIWKfxgQKWiXF-Tw59D9-gaRrxIsTkG_VpN5_OSCKBgGrJt7oKlCeVrW3m0mNY1Jn/s2246/Screenshot_2021-09-06-20-57-58-572_cn.wps.xiaomi.abroad.lite.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2246\" data-original-width=\"1080\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEglbClq4Br4Jhc4-FVu7BruLHJo6nZBJt1ceg0o62GITM2oXvhGUSAqYFfF_4IdcgqRbdUS0cfix27EIWKfxgQKWiXF-Tw59D9-gaRrxIsTkG_VpN5_OSCKBgGrJt7oKlCeVrW3m0mNY1Jn/s320/Screenshot_2021-09-06-20-57-58-572_cn.wps.xiaomi.abroad.lite.jpg\" width=\"154\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-EMkYxgKyowJtBjEDU7nFs3LvoaFfecq_faYlG2oqy8bq7UCtsPAddinYuAnwJfqRdRaCdggpshvL6AQvFwdYOhYjKyXu4tUlQA2OXDcS550PafVKIlQ9NHbZ3RDxCMzGRqtDiki-GGGi/s2246/Screenshot_2021-09-06-20-57-52-977_cn.wps.xiaomi.abroad.lite.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2246\" data-original-width=\"1080\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEh-EMkYxgKyowJtBjEDU7nFs3LvoaFfecq_faYlG2oqy8bq7UCtsPAddinYuAnwJfqRdRaCdggpshvL6AQvFwdYOhYjKyXu4tUlQA2OXDcS550PafVKIlQ9NHbZ3RDxCMzGRqtDiki-GGGi/s320/Screenshot_2021-09-06-20-57-52-977_cn.wps.xiaomi.abroad.lite.jpg\" width=\"154\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.mediafire.com/file/gmmlvbe6odom06s/Semester_II_Mathematics-II_Notes.pdf/file\" target=\"_blank\">Semester II Mathematics-II Notes</a><br /></div><br /><p></p>",
