    "content": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\" trbidi=\"on\">\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi0x7LKvfybJmPLGgG4TnLlTbWPJzWhuLEO3MQqF7-VsXcNzu_wBuf80FsolzfsPzy2zU73R9czCsa-d_Q4oglPbgNfV_4wZf1YWY0iixwXPOEfvfsHjRZ19GFxDNP7GKRspJ2EJvF-MQ9Q/s1600/1579662694041669-0.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\">\n    <img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi0x7LKvfybJmPLGgG4TnLlTbWPJzWhuLEO3MQqF7-VsXcNzu_wBuf80FsolzfsPzy2zU73R9czCsa-d_Q4oglPbgNfV_4wZf1YWY0iixwXPOEfvfsHjRZ19GFxDNP7GKRspJ2EJvF-MQ9Q/s1600/1579662694041669-0.png\" width=\"400\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div>\nDownload Poco F1 Android 10 with MIUI 11&nbsp; Version 11.0.4.0.QEJMIXM</div>\n<div>\n<div class=\"site-inner\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"content-sidebar-wrap\">\n<main class=\"content\" id=\"genesis-content\"></main><br />\n<article class=\"post-197333 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail category-install-stock-rom category-news tag-android-10 tag-android-10-q tag-miui tag-miui-11 tag-xiaomi tag-xiaomi-poco-f1 entry\"><div class=\"entry-content\">\nAs per the screenshot shared by the user, the update carries the size of&nbsp;<strong>1.90GB&nbsp;</strong>via OTA and brings December 2019/January 2020 (not confirmed) security patch along with some other improvements. With the Android 10, Google introduced system-wide dark mode, iOS-like Gesture Navigation, upgraded system UI, privacy controls, and Focus Mode.<br />\n<br />\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjBULDmT9icvL7zQN99Yu8sREV8XAv4cJtutWoUDAcm4fmMQP2jCLBmi7YZyNJYAHat0nVyK6ZPRwWW7Ow1fG2bjjMFg6bRaHjvifLVZwzBpZtaTL_tjWR3nApbPcJn8cdeWjCGq3B2KsJu/s1600/1579662688912723-1.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\">\n    <img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjBULDmT9icvL7zQN99Yu8sREV8XAv4cJtutWoUDAcm4fmMQP2jCLBmi7YZyNJYAHat0nVyK6ZPRwWW7Ow1fG2bjjMFg6bRaHjvifLVZwzBpZtaTL_tjWR3nApbPcJn8cdeWjCGq3B2KsJu/s1600/1579662688912723-1.png\" width=\"400\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhzierq5z7qMhBNK58nEUO5KfQiFc-GSAw2hkK0uWZNEahfM50XHbLE0eyKikyX_-GUwJhI1tNTwnUc-fpUpypB9QZqxIbDRP9cLgtZjJVvDRhpqrlkT9RueToVzLbenpIQUCaHUE26Odcw/s1600/1579662682548786-2.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\">\n    <img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhzierq5z7qMhBNK58nEUO5KfQiFc-GSAw2hkK0uWZNEahfM50XHbLE0eyKikyX_-GUwJhI1tNTwnUc-fpUpypB9QZqxIbDRP9cLgtZjJVvDRhpqrlkT9RueToVzLbenpIQUCaHUE26Odcw/s1600/1579662682548786-2.png\" width=\"400\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n<br />\n<div class=\"code-block code-block-2\">\n</ins></ins></div>\n<div class=\"nv_note_2_outer yellownote\">\n<div class=\"nv_note_2_inner\">\n<div class=\"nv_note_2_content\">\n[System]<br />\nStable MIUI 11 based on Android 1010<br />\n[Status bar, Notification Shade]<br />\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: Couldn’t open notification settings in the Notification shade in Second space</li>\n<li>Fix: Couldn’t open the notification shade in some cases</li>\n</ul>\n[Other improvements and optimizations]<br />\n<ul>\n<li>Optimizations Game Turbo</li>\n</ul>\n[Other]<br />\n<ul>\n<li>Fix: Images overlapped in scrolling screenshoT</li>\n<li>Mirror Link</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</article></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
