    "excerpt": "[Official Method] How To Apply Custom Watch Face For Mi Smart Band 4 Via Mi Fit App Hope you all doing good. You might be using unofficial methods for applying custom watchfaces fo",
    "content": "<div class=\"main post-box \"><h2 id=\"J_shareTitle\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPVGiwWlzn3svxX2S-TxVELcEeFSh3B0a1HZH7UKx4zGG-fcx32mjFYbDtAhzdY8tKsW_RniZiQpEB8tvzgsQPbsYUk7Ney37Lre2sFwOqik6x7hGqOeLKWA1zyYiDi8q_XCs0pFhwiwY/s1600/1579485229152208-0.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\">\n    <img border=\"0\"   src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgPVGiwWlzn3svxX2S-TxVELcEeFSh3B0a1HZH7UKx4zGG-fcx32mjFYbDtAhzdY8tKsW_RniZiQpEB8tvzgsQPbsYUk7Ney37Lre2sFwOqik6x7hGqOeLKWA1zyYiDi8q_XCs0pFhwiwY/s1600/1579485229152208-0.png\" width=\"400\">\n  </a>\n</div><br></h2><h2 id=\"J_shareTitle\">[Official Method] How To Apply Custom Watch Face For Mi Smart Band 4 Via Mi Fit App</h2><div class=\"post-list thread-owner\" id=\"pid12824235\" data-author=\"Mibatman\" data-pid=\"12824235\"><div class=\"auth-owner\"><div class=\"owner-time\"><div class=\"owner-time-action-box\"></div></div><div class=\"content-box\" href=\"#replybtn_12824235\"><div class=\"message clearfix\" id=\"J_shareDesc\"><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=2612691&amp;aid=5034517&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_5034517\" width=\"776\" height=\"392\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/6dc27814-f630-4dfe-b0e3-7dc257a070ee.png\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/6dc27814-f630-4dfe-b0e3-7dc257a070ee.png\" alt=\"Adobe_Post_20191115_021622.png\" title=\"Adobe_Post_20191115_021622.png\"></a></div><br><br><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">Hope you all doing good. You might be using unofficial methods for applying custom watchfaces for Mi smart band 4 but with latest Mi Fit App update you can apply custom watch faces officially. So lets see how we can do it.</font></font><br><br><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#4169e1\"><strong><u>Steps To Change</u></strong></font></font><br><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">1. Open Mi Fit App and then tap on</font><font color=\"#008000\">&nbsp;\"profile\"</font><font color=\"#000000\">.</font></font><br><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. Now tap on&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#008000\">\"mi smart band 4\"</font><font color=\"#000000\">. And then tap on&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#008000\">\"band display settings\"</font><font color=\"#000000\">.</font></font><br><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">3. Swipe left to select&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#008000\">\"custom\"</font><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;option.</font></font><br><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">4. Now you will see 3 layout select anyone according to your wish, and then&nbsp;</font></font><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">tap on&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#008000\">\"change background\"</font><font color=\"#000000\">.</font></font><br><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">5. It will ask you to either change it via&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#008000\">\"Taking photo\"</font><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;or by</font><font color=\"#008000\">&nbsp;\"Gallery\"</font><font color=\"#000000\">. Select according to your wish.</font></font><br><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\">6. Tap on&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#008000\">\"Sync watch face\"</font><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;now it will be applied.</font></font><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></font><div align=\"center\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#4169e1\"><strong><u>Via Gallery</u></strong></font></font></div><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=2612691&amp;aid=5034326&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_5034326\" width=\"776\" height=\"560\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/a5c3253c-ad7d-4292-ad0f-8c48115bc775.jpg\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/a5c3253c-ad7d-4292-ad0f-8c48115bc775.jpg\" alt=\"imgonline-com-ua-twotoone-GMUzTyCHxjW2K.jpg\" title=\"imgonline-com-ua-twotoone-GMUzTyCHxjW2K.jpg\"></a></div><br><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=2612691&amp;aid=5034327&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_5034327\" width=\"776\" height=\"560\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/1954553c-c27c-4d83-984e-e21449742f04.jpg\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/1954553c-c27c-4d83-984e-e21449742f04.jpg\" alt=\"imgonline-com-ua-twotoone-EmWx84WwFw.jpg\" title=\"imgonline-com-ua-twotoone-EmWx84WwFw.jpg\"></a></div><br><div align=\"center\"><strong><u><i><font color=\"#4169e1\">After Applying</font></i></u></strong></div><br><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=2612691&amp;aid=5034358&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_5034358\" width=\"509\" height=\"776\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/6577e121-47e5-47aa-b03b-dbe8842d0dc1.jpg\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/6577e121-47e5-47aa-b03b-dbe8842d0dc1.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20191111_221039.jpg\" title=\"IMG_20191111_221039.jpg\"></a></div><br><div align=\"center\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#4169e1\"><strong><u>Via Taking Photo</u></strong></font></font></div><br><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=2612691&amp;aid=5015379&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_5015379\" width=\"776\" height=\"560\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/11/3d4af930-af7b-44ae-a81e-10edbadd5cc0.jpg\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/11/3d4af930-af7b-44ae-a81e-10edbadd5cc0.jpg\" alt=\"imgonline-com-ua-twotoone-9HCX91SfB46Ya8Rm.jpg\" title=\"imgonline-com-ua-twotoone-9HCX91SfB46Ya8Rm.jpg\"></a></div><br><div align=\"center\"><strong><i><u><font color=\"#4169e1\">After Applying</font></u></i></strong></div><div align=\"center\"><strong><i><u><font color=\"#4169e1\"><br></font></u></i></strong></div><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=2612691&amp;aid=5034415&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_5034415\" width=\"558\" height=\"776\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/2ac1e33e-95d6-40e1-b65a-98a054e82646.jpg\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/11/15/2ac1e33e-95d6-40e1-b65a-98a054e82646.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_20191115_015525.jpg\" title=\"IMG_20191115_015525.jpg\"></a></div><div align=\"center\"><strong><i><u><font color=\"#4169e1\"><br></font></u></i></strong></div><div align=\"center\"><i><font color=\"#008000\"><strong>Hope You Liked This Feature</strong></font></i></div><br><div align=\"center\"><strong><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#800080\"><font face=\"ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\"><font face=\"ProximaNova, Arial, sans-serif\">Special Thanks</font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></font></strong></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
