    "readTime": "2 min read",
    "image": "https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgbbxQkG-0pJs1YX3x3I6ehYA90Yo-rcRTWcN97t5tQ_GJ9QXlAr4sARxbOXf3LgWVy3U0PGfSqnpGSAV1zupV-ss5Ax36NJE5orZm2CSQJA-6w8zUr8n_Wdb1CL2WbaiMIbkGep6GcWzY/s1600/1579271189836350-0.png",
    "excerpt": "How To Create MIUI Theme Designer Account? Step by Step Guide Greetings everyone, Wecome to our new home OC Community. Warm welcome to our Theme subforum. We have lots of good desi",
    "content": "<div class=\"main post-box \"><h2 id=\"J_shareTitle\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n  <a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgbbxQkG-0pJs1YX3x3I6ehYA90Yo-rcRTWcN97t5tQ_GJ9QXlAr4sARxbOXf3LgWVy3U0PGfSqnpGSAV1zupV-ss5Ax36NJE5orZm2CSQJA-6w8zUr8n_Wdb1CL2WbaiMIbkGep6GcWzY/s1600/1579271189836350-0.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\">\n    <img border=\"0\"   src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgbbxQkG-0pJs1YX3x3I6ehYA90Yo-rcRTWcN97t5tQ_GJ9QXlAr4sARxbOXf3LgWVy3U0PGfSqnpGSAV1zupV-ss5Ax36NJE5orZm2CSQJA-6w8zUr8n_Wdb1CL2WbaiMIbkGep6GcWzY/s1600/1579271189836350-0.png\" width=\"400\">\n  </a>\n</div><br></h2><h2 id=\"J_shareTitle\">How To Create MIUI Theme Designer Account? Step by Step Guide</h2><h2 id=\"J_shareTitle\">Greetings everyone,</h2><div class=\"post-list thread-owner\" id=\"pid9779017\" data-author=\"Katrix\" data-pid=\"9779017\"><div class=\"auth-owner\"><div class=\"content-box\" href=\"#replybtn_9779017\"><div class=\"message clearfix\" id=\"J_shareDesc\"><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"Verdana\">Wecome to our new home OC Community. Warm welcome to our Theme subforum. We have lots of good designers who works pretty hard to create beautiful themes. Personally I am a big fan of dynamic themes. I use China ROM just for the amazing dyanamic themes. Many designer want to share their themes on bigger platform but they dont know how so here is the easy solution - MIUI Theme Designer account.</font></font><br><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><br></font></font><br><font color=\"#424242\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><font size=\"4\"><strong>What is MIUI Theme Designer Station?</strong></font></font></font><br><div class=\"grey quote quote-thread\"><blockquote>Its a portal for all designer's to upload their work to Official MIUI Theme store.</blockquote></div><br><font face=\"Verdana\"><font size=\"4\"><font color=\"#424242\"><strong>How To Create MIUI Theme Designer Account?</strong></font></font></font><br><br><ul><li><font face=\"Verdana\"><font color=\"#424242\">Go to&nbsp;</font></font><a href=\"http://designer.xiaomi.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://designer.xiaomi.com/</a></li><li>If you already have Mi Account click \"Login now\" else click \"Register Now\"<br></li></ul><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1920416&amp;aid=4147250&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_4147250\" width=\"776\" height=\"270\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/4daf67a7-4b49-46dc-bded-479fd9a294c5.png\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/4daf67a7-4b49-46dc-bded-479fd9a294c5.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_1.png\" title=\"Screenshot_1.png\"></a><br><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1920416&amp;aid=4147254&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_4147254\" width=\"776\" height=\"327\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/591c93b1-d374-4f44-8407-c891da8cbbab.png\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/591c93b1-d374-4f44-8407-c891da8cbbab.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_5.png\" title=\"Screenshot_5.png\"></a><br><ul><li>After you login you will see the page as shown below. Click \"Individual Designer\"<br></li></ul><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1920416&amp;aid=4147251&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_4147251\" width=\"776\" height=\"347\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/771300f8-6bd1-4e3a-8257-795c4ec33482.png\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/771300f8-6bd1-4e3a-8257-795c4ec33482.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_2.png\" title=\"Screenshot_2.png\"></a><br><ul><li>Filll up the correct details in the form. Bind phone number for better security.<br></li></ul><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1920416&amp;aid=4147252&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_4147252\" width=\"776\" height=\"688\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/8c7623cf-bb64-4dd2-845f-794ada55f90b.png\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/8c7623cf-bb64-4dd2-845f-794ada55f90b.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_3.png\" title=\"Screenshot_3.png\"></a><br>Designer name&nbsp;&nbsp;: The name that will appear below theme name in official theme store. You can use your name or some creative name as well.Real Name&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;: Your real full name<br>Personal Photo&nbsp;&nbsp;: Your photo where face is clearly visible. Selfies are preferred.<br>Permanent Add : Your permanent resident address.<br><br><ul><li>After filling up all the correct details, Double check all detail then click \"Read Agreement\" to read the agreement. Agreement is in Chinese s here is the translated version. This is translated edition which means words may differ from Chinese agreement so it is not the official one. We don't gurantee of the perfect accuracy.<br></li></ul><div id=\"attach_4147232\" class=\"box attach mbn thread-download\"><p class=\"attach-title\">Designer Agreement.pdf</p><p>39.27 KB Downloads:</p><a class=\"attach-down\" href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=attachment&amp;aid=NDE0NzIzMnxmMzdhNDEwZXwxNTc5MjcxMDgzfDB8MTkyMDQxNg%3D%3D\"></a></div><br><ul><li>After reading agreement click \"Accept Agreement and Register\"<br></li></ul><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1920416&amp;aid=4147255&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_4147255\" width=\"714\" height=\"188\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/77d38ee6-f2f1-45f2-a3f8-a67cb1b1739f.png\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/77d38ee6-f2f1-45f2-a3f8-a67cb1b1739f.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_6.png\" title=\"Screenshot_6.png\"></a><br><ul><li>It will redirect you to following page. Now wait for approval. You will get notified via email when your application is accepted. It may take upto 1 month. Its sooner if all details are correct.</li><li>After Approval you will get access to Designer Station like this.<br></li></ul><a href=\"https://c.mi.com/forum.php?mod=viewthread&amp;tid=1920416&amp;aid=4147256&amp;from=album&amp;page=1\" class=\"orange\"><img id=\"aimg_4147256\" width=\"776\" height=\"65\" class=\"J_orangeImg\" src=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/67087cd9-ae50-40c7-a3f5-c494a7eaf9a7.png\" data-file=\"https://u01.appmifile.com/images/2019/04/23/67087cd9-ae50-40c7-a3f5-c494a7eaf9a7.png\" alt=\"Screenshot_7.png\" title=\"Screenshot_7.png\"></a><br><ul><li>Enjoy upload your designed themes to official theme store.</li></ul></div></div></div></div></div>",
