    "excerpt": "Mi Remote V5.8.5.2G Released: Changelog and Download Links. Hello Mi Fans! Mi Remote is an all-in-one app to control all your household electronic appliances such as TV, AC, Set-To",
    "content": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\" trbidi=\"on\">\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiVVFYixmazYOY1GuR2PVGTr_UsUShrfRdOrIx1nhHF4lLOgxrW66xWxn2cML0Ssac6pQtUL0KFg2xr4gNI7vIZXTJaZCbiiX5rse2LB6RiyTn6Wo186NTFHMfVcmm9I4cdinOCnSTxigU/s1600/Mi+Community1577934401198.png\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"305\" data-original-width=\"776\" height=\"125\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiVVFYixmazYOY1GuR2PVGTr_UsUShrfRdOrIx1nhHF4lLOgxrW66xWxn2cML0Ssac6pQtUL0KFg2xr4gNI7vIZXTJaZCbiiX5rse2LB6RiyTn6Wo186NTFHMfVcmm9I4cdinOCnSTxigU/s320/Mi+Community1577934401198.png\" width=\"320\" /></a></div>\nMi Remote V5.8.5.2G Released: Changelog and Download Links.<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nHello Mi Fans!<br />\n<br />\nMi Remote is an all-in-one app to control all your household electronic appliances such as TV, AC, Set-Top Box etc. Mi Remote has all the information you need about your favorite TV shows, so you can switch the channels faster or even watch the shows running on your mobile phone.<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nSupported Appliances:&nbsp;TV, Air Conditioner, Set Top Box, DVD Player, Projector, AV Receiver, Camera etc.<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nSupported Brands:&nbsp;Samsung, LG, Sony, Panasonic, Sharp, Haier, Videocon, Micromax, Onida etc.<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nSupported Phones:&nbsp;Samsung S4/S5/S6/S6 Edge/Note 3/Note 4, HTC One Series, Mi 4/Mi 4c/Mi 5/Redmi 4/Redmi Note 2/Redmi Note3, Huawei Honor 3/6/6 Plus etc.<br />\n<br />\n<br />\nWhat's New:Fixed some Bugs.<br />\n<br />\n<a href=\"http://download.appmifile.com/images/2019/12/26/10b0d3c7-b27a-410f-8ff1-09a134794407.apk\" target=\"_blank\">DOWNLAOD LINK</a></div>",
